-- Standard researcher types (Research > Researcher Types, table research_researcher_type).
--
-- Until this seed, a fresh install had none: registration offered no researcher type and the
-- admin list was empty. INSERT IGNORE keyed on the unique `code`, so a site that has edited or
-- added types keeps them. Booking limits, expiry and reproduction rights are starting values
-- for each site to adjust. Wording is jurisdiction-neutral.

